OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFBI reportedly investigating apparent  
OL,4,Ahack of its criminal database          
OL,6,FThis comes after a string of tech      
OL,7,Foutages which hit banking, air traffic 
OL,8,Fcontrol and other sectors in the US    
OL,9,Flast week. Officials have said they    
OL,10,Fwere not caused by cyberattacks, but   
OL,11,Fthe blackouts have sparked scrutiny    
OL,12,Ffrom lawmakers.                        
OL,14,FWhite House National Cyber Director    
OL,15,FSean Cairncross was fired this week,   
OL,16,Fwith US President Donald Trump saying  
OL,17,Fhe was not good enough.                
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
