OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AFrench police officers sentenced for   
OL,4,Abeating of music producer Michel Zecler
OL,6,FTheir lies were exposed because the    
OL,7,Fwhole scene at Zecler's recording      
OL,8,Fstudio was caught on CCTV, revealing   
OL,9,Fthe producer had suffered some 30      
OL,10,Fpunches, kicks and baton strikes while 
OL,11,Foffering little resistance at all.     
OL,13,FAurelien Lapersonne, 29, Philippe      
OL,14,FTondeux, 50, and Pierre Plantier, 37,  
OL,15,Fall received five year sentences, with 
OL,16,Fdifferent amounts suspended.           
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
